---

<footer class="bg-bg border-t border-primary/30 py-16 px-6 md:px-12 relative z-30">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-12">
    
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-6 col-span-1 md:col-span-2">
      <a href="#inicio" class="flex items-center gap-3">
        <img src="/Logo.png" alt="Firma Legal Logo" class="h-12 w-auto" />
        <div class="flex flex-col">
          <span class="font-playfair text-xl font-bold tracking-wide text-text leading-none">FIRMA LEGAL</span>
          <span class="font-josefin text-xs tracking-[0.2em] text-gold mt-1">CONSULTORES</span>
        </div>
      </a>
      <p class="font-dmsans text-sm font-light text-text/70 max-w-sm leading-relaxed">
        Defendemos sus derechos con impecabilidad institucional, rigor profesional y un firme compromiso ético.
      </p>
      
      <div class="flex gap-4 mt-2">
        <a href="https://linkedin.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="w-10 h-10 border border-primary/40 hover:border-primary flex items-center justify-center text-text/70 hover:text-primary transition-all duration-300 interactive-hover" aria-label="LinkedIn">
          <i class="ph ph-linkedin-logo text-lg"></i>
        </a>
        <a href="https://instagram.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="w-10 h-10 border border-primary/40 hover:border-primary flex items-center justify-center text-text/70 hover:text-primary transition-all duration-300 interactive-hover" aria-label="Instagram">
          <i class="ph ph-instagram-logo text-lg"></i>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
      <h3 class="font-playfair text-base font-bold text-gold uppercase tracking-wider">Enlaces</h3>
      <ul class="flex flex-col gap-3 font-dmsans text-sm font-light text-text/70">
        <li><a href="#inicio" class="hover:text-primary transition-colors py-1 block">Inicio</a></li>
        <li><a href="#servicios" class="hover:text-primary transition-colors py-1 block">Servicios</a></li>
        <li><a href="#nosotros" class="hover:text-primary transition-colors py-1 block">Nosotros</a></li>
        <li><a href="#contacto" class="hover:text-primary transition-colors py-1 block">Contacto</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
      <h3 class="font-playfair text-base font-bold text-gold uppercase tracking-wider">Contacto</h3>
      <ul class="flex flex-col gap-3 font-dmsans text-sm font-light text-text/70">
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <i class="ph ph-map-pin text-primary text-lg mt-0.5"></i>
          <span>Av. Principal 123, Ciudad, País.</span>
        </li>

        <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <i class="ph ph-envelope-simple text-primary text-lg"></i>
          <a href="mailto:contacto@firmalegal.com" class="hover:text-primary transition-colors">contacto@firmalegal.com</a>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
  
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto gold-divider my-10 opacity-30"></div>
  
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-center gap-4 font-dmsans text-xs font-light text-text/60">
    <p>© {new Date().getFullYear()} Firma Legal. Todos los derechos reservados.</p>
    <div class="flex gap-6">
      <a href="#aviso-privacidad" class="hover:text-primary transition-colors">Aviso de Privacidad</a>
      <a href="#terminos-condiciones" class="hover:text-primary transition-colors">Términos y Condiciones</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
